{
  "_about": "The Outgrow boot camp: loads 'PM Bootcamp' (outgrow-bootcamp-make.json: six lands of odd angles, circles, curves, blocks, triangles, wedges) and plans every garden again twice the old way (emergent 0) and twice the current way (emergent 1); after each second round the garden report (gardens-<way>.txt/.json: edges per garden with shared ones counted by each, corner angles, flags, the worst) and coverage (coverage-<way>.json: the land within 40 m of a road and what that encloses, how much of it is in a garden), the fence map, and the passes (passes/<way>/, OutgrowBench). Draw it with node tools/suite/GardenMap.js <run folder> <way>. No growing: the same buildings every time. Send with: powershell -File tools/suite/Send-Suite.ps1 -File suite/scenarios/outgrow-bootcamp.json -Who outgrow-bootcamp",
